  "title": "STOMP Out Bad Metrics",
  "summary": "How do we ensure consistency, accuracy, and relevancy? And more importantly, how do we ensure operating measures - metrics - already in use are trustworthy and measuring as intended? Social Technology Operating Measures Principles - or STOMP - is a set of principles to help standardize the measurement and qualification of metrics.",
